Wait, `max-width: min(460px, calc(100vw - 340px))` — at width 844 → 504 → 460. At 740 → 400. At 667 (iPhone SE landscape 667x375) → 327. Hmm 327 is narrow; the menu items have 16+36+gap+text+24 = ~110 fixed, leaving 200 for text. "НОВАЯ ИГРА" at 9px pixel font ~ 60px. Subtext "Начать спуск · SOUL TRIAL" at 12px ~ 150px. Fits ~200. OK.

But the launcher-view also is inside `.app` flex; with `max-width` and `margin: 0 auto` it centers. Good.

However `.launcher-view` at max-width 900 has `padding: 20px 18px calc(24px + safe)` from the earlier media query; my later rule overrides padding.

